	(text "PowerPath Priority:\nPoE\nVIN\nVUSB2 (CONFIG ESP32)\nVUSB (CONFIG MOSAIC)\n\nVUSB2 is prioritized over VUSB as:\nCONFIG MOSAIC is more likely to be\nused for USB data and connected to\na USB 2.0 port; CONFIG ESP32 is\nless likely to be used for USB data\nand easier to connect to a Power\nDelivery supply."
